<title>EGYPT: EgyptAir raises domestic fares 15 percent.</title>
<headline>EgyptAir raises domestic fares 15 percent.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>National carrier EgyptAir is raising domestic air fares by about 15 percent with effect from October 1, travel agents said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The one-way fare from Cairo to the southern town of Luxor, one of the most popular routes, will go up to 127 pounds from 110 pounds for residents and to $121 from $105 for non-residents, they said. Those fares are net of tax.</p>
<p>It is the first increase for more than a year.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.40 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
